    "number": "Theorem (thm:OCO-main-result)",
    "quote": "Suppose $C \\ge \\ln T + 1$, and consider $\\cW(\\gA, \\gD)$ ... where $\\gA$ is DW-FTRL. With rates $\\eta_t = \\tfrac{D/G}{\\sqrt{\\dtot + T}}$ and $\\gD$ from Corollary~\\ref{cor:pareto-scheduler}, $\\cW(\\gA, \\gD)$ guarantees $\\widebar R_T(x^*) = O\\rbr{GD\\,{\\sqrt{\\dtot + T}}}$."
   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "Proof gives explicit 18 G D sqrt(d_tot+T) + G D. Expected regret against best fixed point in hindsight with oblivious losses. Same guarantee in the non-preemptive / clairvoyant variant per Appendix."
